### Session + CSRF (HTTP client keeps cookies)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrf", response.body.token); %}

### Register (change username before repeating)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"username":"portfolio_demo","password":"portfolio123","timezone":"Europe/Istanbul"}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"username":"portfolio_demo","password":"portfolio123"}

### Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### Create a counter
POST http://localhost:8080/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Drink water","description":"","kind":"counter","target":5,"unit":"glasses"}

> {% client.global.set("habitId", response.body.id); %}

### Increment (can exceed target)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/habits/{{habitId}}/increment
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Decrement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/habits/{{habitId}}/decrement
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Last 26 weeks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/habits/{{habitId}}/heatmap?days=182

### Same range statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/habits/{{habitId}}/statistics?days=182

### Activity newest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/activity?page=0&size=30

### Edit profile
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Amil","bio":"Portfolio","timezone":"Europe/Istanbul"}

### Logout (get a fresh CSRF token before next login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
